# Canonical host is www.robertopianastudio.com (site.json, sitemap, rel=canonical).
#
# Host redirects are NOT in this file. Cloudflare rejects absolute URLs here and
# fails the whole deploy. Those hops are Cloudflare Redirect Rules — README §8.
# rpdesigngroup.com stays at Hostinger; do not move its nameservers, because
# @rpdesigngroup.com mail is hosted there.
#
# The CMS lives only at /admin. Plain 301 so Cloudflare accepts the line.
# Cloudflare follows it even when the /en/admin HTML fallback also exists.
/en/admin/*  /admin/  301
/en/admin    /admin/  301

# Legacy rpdesigngroup.com paths. These still rank in Google (la-storia, contattaci,
# commerciale/showroom, chi-siamo/il-team). Map each to its nearest surviving page.
/la-storia            /studio/    301
/chi-siamo/il-team    /studio/    301
/chi-siamo/*          /studio/    301
/contattaci           /contatti/  301
/commerciale/showroom /contatti/  301

# No catch-all 404 lines. Cloudflare would treat a 404 status here as invalid
# or, worse, as a redirect of every page. Missing URLs are answered by
# Cloudflare not_found_handling = 404-page, which serves the nearest 404.html:
# /en/404.html under /en/, /404.html everywhere else.
